<div class="lf-h1">🤖 <div class="lf-h1"><span>🪤</span> 陷阱診斷專區 — 高品質陷阱題</div>
    <p>以下題目來自霖楓教研團隊精心設計，每題針對一個常見考試陷阱。做完即知你的陷阱弱項！</p>
    <div class="lf-trap-section">
        <div class="lf-trap-card" data-trap="T1" data-hq-id="LF-T1-AUTO">
            <div class="lf-trap-header">
                <span class="lf-trap-badge">T1</span>
                <span class="lf-trap-diff">⭐⭐ 🔴</span>
                <span class="lf-trap-id">LF-T1-AUTO</span>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="lf-trap-q">一件衫原價$200，先加價20%，再打八折。最終售價是多少？</div>
                <div class="lf-trap-wrong">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">常見錯誤</span>
                    <span >$200×1.2×0.8 = $192，所以平咗$8。</span>
                </div>
                <div class="lf-trap-right">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">正確思路</span>
                    <span >正確！$200×1.2×0.8=$192。但陷阱係：你以為加咗20%再減20%=原價？錯！$200×1.2×0.8=$192≠$200！</span>
                </div>
                <div class="lf-trap-note">💡 加減相同百分比唔會還原！</div>
            </div>
        </div>
<div class="lf-trap-card" data-trap="T2" data-hq-id="LF-T2-AUTO">
            <div class="lf-trap-header">
                <span class="lf-trap-badge">T2</span>
                <span class="lf-trap-diff">⭐⭐ 🔴</span>
                <span class="lf-trap-id">LF-T2-AUTO</span>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="lf-trap-q">商店說「買二送一」，相當於幾多折？</div>
                <div class="lf-trap-wrong">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">常見錯誤</span>
                    <span >買二送一=送33%=六七折。</span>
                </div>
                <div class="lf-trap-right">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">正確思路</span>
                    <span >正確：3件只需付2件價錢，折扣=2÷3≈66.7%，即約六七折。但小心：如果四捨五入至最接近的整折，係六七折唔係六折！</span>
                </div>
                <div class="lf-trap-note">💡 買二送一 = 2/3 ≈ 67%，不是60%！</div>
            </div>
        </div>
<div class="lf-trap-card" data-trap="T3" data-hq-id="LF-T3-AUTO">
            <div class="lf-trap-header">
                <span class="lf-trap-badge">T3</span>
                <span class="lf-trap-diff">⭐⭐⭐ 🔴</span>
                <span class="lf-trap-id">LF-T3-AUTO</span>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="lf-trap-q">一件商品成本$300，以40%盈利定價，再打八折出售。賺定蝕？</div>
                <div class="lf-trap-wrong">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">常見錯誤</span>
                    <span >定價=$300×1.4=$420，八折=$336，賺$36。</span>
                </div>
                <div class="lf-trap-right">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">正確思路</span>
                    <span >正確！但要留意：有啲同學會直接用$300×40%=$120當盈利，但八折後盈利只得$36。考試會考你呢個「折扣後仲有冇賺」嘅概念！</span>
                </div>
                <div class="lf-trap-note">💡 打折後的實際利潤 = 定價×折扣率 − 成本</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
<div class="lf-h1">AI 智能補充練習</div>
